{"about_the_game":"How can a slime change the world around it? In this incredible <strong>cozy game</strong>, experience the relaxing journey of <strong>cleaning</strong> with acids, automatic <strong>repairs</strong>, and a unique story!<br><br>Slime the Cleaner is a simple game where your goal is to relax and clean everything around you.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to clean?</h2></strong><br><br>Clean and repair everything around you! Meet the best cleaner in the world: Slime. With various acids available, you can change your own chemistry and appearance to clean even the toughest stains. And if that's not enough, we also have upgrades to choose from! <br><br><strong>Talk to everyone!</strong> Skeletons, golems, giant rats, and much more\u2014all needing your services, each with a story to tell. Will you be able to help them all? <br><br><strong>Explore a world</strong> full of castles, dungeons, hideouts, and more! All in need of immediate cleaning. Watch everything transform with each step you take.<br><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Come visit our Kickstarter Page!</h2><br>Help contribute to our campaign and get the game for $2 now!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159310/extras/SlimeTheCleanerKick600.png?t=1742758453\" /><br><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rapid Reformation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159310/e1f697423d22ceec6711ae02ab369efe8ba28e6e.jpg"},{"name":"No Time for Traps!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159310/536b4d01de0050cd1ad5a8b0470d64ac03c5cec5.jpg"},{"name":"Fastest Broom in the Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159310/a8055c04a27b2f9fec1525b5d6d1d7b2d39a28a9.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Wit, Quick Clean!","path":"https:/